OL,3,AHaigh and Burghart clash over welfare
OL,4,Abill at deputy PMQs
OL,5,
OL,6,FSenior cabinet minister Louise Haigh
OL,7,Ffaces questions at deputy PMQs - watch
OL,8,Flive at the top of the page
OL,10,FDeputy Conservative Party leader Alex
OL,11,FBurghart presses her on the
OL,12,Fgovernment's welfare spending plans -
OL,13,Fsaying the bill is "higher than ever
OL,14,Fbefore"
OL,16,FHaigh says they are "committed to
OL,17,Fkeeping the benefits bill down", and
OL,18,Fblames the previous Tory government for
OL,19,Fthe current situation
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
